    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, the \"critics argue\" part feels a bit vague. like, is there actually data showing it kills investment, or is that just the standard talking point from people who don't want to pay more? i've heard a lot of experts saying the capital flight stuff is exaggerated.",
      "source": "evaluator"
